      "paragraphs": [
        "SPOTLIGHT ZONE",
        "SPOTLIGHT ZONE",
        "SUPERSTARS",
        "SpiceJet",
        "Meet the achievers of the month from the SpiceJet family, who have stood out for their outstanding work.",
        "Internal Appreciation",
        "Ranjith is truly a great asset for the team. His value-add as an employee is phenomenal, as it’s not just restricted to the typical job definitions. You can count on Ranjith for anything and everything – be it owning the quality of a product, mentoring the junior resources in the team or even contributing to build great dynamics in the team. We are grateful for all his contributions and good work.",
        "Abhilash is an exceptional team leader and thorough professional with a strong foundation in customer service and security. His commendable career growth reflects a dedicated focus on ensuring safe, secure, and comfortable passenger experiences. As he continues to rise through the ranks, he is undoubtedly on track to set new benchmarks across the aviation industry. Wishing him the very best.",
        "RANJITH RAJAGOPAL",
        "IT Department",
        "Experience with SpiceJet",
        "Over the past 5-odd years as a Software QA professional, I have led multiple critical projects, driving quality through strong test strategies, automation initiatives, and focused security testing. My journey at SpiceJet has been filled with continuous learning, challenges, and opportunities to enhance both my technical and leadership skills. With the support of our leadership and the highly collaborative, cross-functional teams, I have been able to deliver meaningful outcomes and uphold high standards of quality across various deliverables. I am grateful to be part of an organisation that encourages growth, innovation, and excellence – that’s the very culture so passionately espoused by our Chairman and CTO.",
        "Internal Appreciation",
        "ABHILASH GOPALKRISHNAN",
        "Airport Services",
        "Experience with SpiceJet",
        "I began my career with SpiceJet as a Trainee Security Executive and, through consistent performance and dedication, progressed across Security and Airport Services to my current role as Station Manager at BLR. Over the past 20 years, SpiceJet – my first and only professional home – has provided a dynamic platform to build operational depth, cross-functional expertise, and leadership capability. I am deeply grateful to my seniors and the management for their trust, mentorship, and encouragement, which have enabled me to contribute meaningfully to operational excellence and team success. The collaborative culture and strong leadership support at SpiceJet have been instrumental in shaping my growth and career journey."
      ],
