        "SPOTLIGHT ZONE",
        "SUPERSTARS",
        "SpiceJet",
        "Meet the achievers of the month from the SpiceJet family, who have stood out for their outstanding work.",
        "Internal Appreciation",
        "Internal Appreciation",
        "Anirudh has consistently demonstrated remarkable resilience in challenging situations. Not only does he take care of himself, he also ensures that those around him remain calm and reassured, regardless of the circumstances. Anirudh is truly an asset to SpiceJet. We are incredibly proud to have such an inspiring example among us, someone whose strength, composure, and selflessness motivate us all to be better.",
        "Sonam has consistently demonstrated sincerity, exceptional dedication, and a strong work ethic. Her willingness to take on challenges with a positive attitude and commitment to delivering results has been truly commendable. She is a dedicated team member whose hard work, perseverance, and positive attitude consistently contribute to the team’s success. We wish her growth in her career.",
        "Sagar has consistently demonstrated exceptional leadership and commitment in managing corporate travel, hotel accommodations, and logistics operations for SpiceJet. He has successfully streamlined manual processes through automation, resulting in improved efficiency and cost optimisation. His proactive approach and ability to handle operations as well as IROPS have significantly contributed to operational excellence.",
        "ANIRUDH VEMULAKONDA",
        "SAGAR JOSHI",
        "Inflight Services",
        "Travel & Transport",
        "Experience with SpiceJet",
        "Experience with SpiceJet",
        "Working with SpiceJet has been an amazing journey, especially moving up to lead flights as Senior Cabin Crew. What I love most about this airline is the sense of Apnaapan – it’s a very close-knit team where everyone genuinely looks out for one another. And every time we welcome passengers on board, our goal is to bring that same family feeling into the cabin.",
        "Even with my 13-plus years of experience in the industry, SpiceJet has helped me expand my horizons. Tasked with the responsibility of overseeing travel and accommodation requirements and driving process-automation initiatives, I have been able to ensure efficient and cost-effective travel operations, thanks to the trust placed in me by the management.",
