        "Rooted in the philosophy of Swami Rama, Swami Rama Himalayan University integrates education, healthcare and community service to shape future-ready professionals. In the Himalayan foothills, Swami Rama Himalayan University is shaping a model where education, healthcare and service come together to guide purposeful lives.",
