        "SPOTLIGHT ZONE",
        "SUPERSTARS",
        "SpiceJet",
        "Meet the achievers of the month from the SpiceJet family, who have stood out for their outstanding work.",
        "Internal Appreciation",
        "Internal Appreciation",
        "I commend Adil for his exceptional support and professionalism, demonstrated over a period of time. His approach is consistently marked by efficiency, politeness, and a strong sense of responsibility. He ensures that all matters are handled seamlessly and with great attention to detail. What stands out most is his proactive attitude and commitment to completing tasks within timelines.",
        "Pankaj is a great team player, someone who has consistently shown the utmost dedication, professionalism, and commitment towards his work. His efforts and positive spirit have contributed greatly to the SpiceJet team, and we sincerely appreciate his valuable contributions. Wishing Pankaj all the best; both professionally as well as personally.",
        "Rishabh Jha has been among the standout performers in the Reservations department – his hard work, professionalism and team spirit set him apart. Always stepping forward in challenging situations, he has never hesitated to extend his support whenever the department needed it. Rishabh’s positive attitude, reliability, and willingness to go the extra mile make him a highly-¬valued member of the team.",
        "ADIL JILLA",
        "RISHABH JHA",
        "Inflight Service",
        "Reservations",
        "Experience with SpiceJet",
        "Experience with SpiceJet",
        "My 15-year journey with SpiceJet has been truly meaningful and full of learning. It’s given me the opportunity to grow, take on responsibilities, and work with some amazing people. I have always believed in supporting my team in every possible way, and I value the trust and backing I have received, which has motivated me to keep giving my best to the organisation.",
        "SpiceJet is my first job, and in this a journey of three-and-a-half years, the organisation has helped me recognise my potential, and continuously encouraged me to perform with confidence, integrity, and dedication. I would like to thank my seniors for believing in me and acknowledging my efforts, and every fellow SpiceJetter for creating such a kind, supportive, and cheerful work culture.",
        "Internal Appreciation",
        "PANKAJ CHOUDHARY",
        "Customer Experience",
        "Experience with SpiceJet",
        "When I started my journey with SpiceJet, I never imagined how much I would learn. It hasn’t always been easy—there were challenges, and I had my moments of doubt, but each step helped me grow, and made me a much stronger and wiser person. And the support of my colleagues and seniors has allowed me to scale new heights."
