      "printedPage": 34,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Fly Better with SpiceJet",
        "From offering maximum privileges at minimum price to special fares for special people, SPICEJET brings you a slew of benefits to make your travel more convenient and memorable",
        "SPICEMAX: MAX COMFORT AT MIN PRICE",
        "Now get the best seat in the sky with SpiceMax and enjoy extra comfort and more privileges. Apart from a more comfortable and spacious seating option with",
        "significantly extra legroom, you will be offered a delicious",
        "meal with a beverage. Avail of priority services and a lot more to make your travel extra special! All this is for a modest add-on fee",
        "starting from INR 799 for domestic flights and INR 1,599",
        "on international routes. Please note that prices may vary",
        "as per flight. As they say, it's not the destination but the",
        "journey that matters. So book your SpiceMax seat and",
        "upgrade your flying experience.",
        "SPICELOCK",
        "Here's an offering from SpiceJet that can make",
        "flying with us even more cost effective and",
        "smart. SpiceLock lets you hold your ticket at the same price for 48 hours, as you take time to make your decision. If you have found a ticket at the right fare, hold it with SpiceLock, so as to ensure that you are protected from surging prices and selling out of tickets. What makes it even more exciting is that you can lock the fare with or without passenger names and",
        "book only if your travel is confirmed. Available",
        "on both domestic and international routes, SpiceLock is applicable only on bookings made through www.spicejet.com and mobile app.",
        "SPICEPLUS: EXTRA BENEFITS AT NO EXTRA COST",
        "Travelling with safety, comfort and convenience is a choice. With SpicePlus, you can save time with Priority Services like shorter and quicker queues at check-in, quicker and smoother boarding, and lesser waiting time with preferred baggage delivery. You also get to enjoy the convenience of your choice of preferred seat and a meal with a beverage. Add",
        "SpicePlus to your booking and get all these benefits",
        "for a starting price of just INR 400. Visit www.spicejet.com to book SpicePlus.",
        "SPICEJET",
        "REDHOT",
        "April 2024"
      ],
