        "This fare can be booked from SpiceJet website, mobile app, reservation centres, airport, and through travel agents. Select this fare on the Flight Selection page and avail",
        "the associated benefits.",
        "VISA SERVICES",
        "Flying to an international destination has never been easier, with SpiceJet bringing you an easy visa process service. Apply online with the simplest and most convenient visa application process for visas to the UAE, Saudi Arabia, Thailand, Bangladesh, Hong Kong, Sri Lanka, the UK, Singapore, Schengen and many more countries.",
        "TAXI, PLEASE!",
        "We want you safe and at ease not only in the air but also on the ground. Book SpiceJet’s Taxi Service for a seamless end-to-end passenger experience - travel stress-free to and from the airport. The taxi service comes with multiple",
        "benefits such as zero cancellation fee",
        "and no waiting time with 100 per cent",
        "confirmed and sanitised cabs every",
        "time you ride. The service is available at all major domestic airports and in Dubai, offering unmatched doorstep convenience. Additionally, you also get instant cash-back on completing your ride with SpiceJet’s Taxi Service.",
