        "ARMED FORCES",
        "For the brave men and women of the Indian Armed forces who are keeping the nation safe, SpiceJet offers up to 21 per cent discount on base fares. The discount is valid on bookings that are made online at SpiceJet website, mobile app or through our reservation numbers. It is also available at select airport ticketing",
