        "Stars Of SpiceJet",
        "Meet the achievers of the month from the SpiceJet family, who have stood out for their outstanding work",
        "RAHUL SHARMA",
        "GURUGRAM",
        "Internal appreciation:",
        "Rahul's performance has been outstanding during his tenure. His commitment towards his duties shows that he is a valuable asset to the department as well as the organisation.",
        "Experience with SpiceJet:",
        "I have been associated with this organisation",
        "for the past five years. I started as a",
        "Reservation Executive and moved to the Customer Experience department after three years. It has been an amazing journey.",
        "I express my sincere gratitude to my seniors and the team members along the way. All the things that I have learned here have not only helped me in my professional life but personally as well. The most important thing that I have learned during my journey is to never give up and be consistent in my work.",
        "Customer experience",
        "NAYAN PUROHIT",
        "GURUGRAM",
        "PRASHANT CHANDRA",
        "GURUGRAM",
        "Internal appreciation:",
        "Nayan has grown professionally from a Cabin Crew position to a Managerial Position in the last 10+ years at SpiceJet. He has a positive attitude and is highly energetic. He is ready to take up new challenges and is always open to feedback. As a Manager, he leads the team in every circumstance with the experience he has gained in the Operations and Staff Development domain.",
        "Experience with SpiceJet:",
        "The",
        "last decade with SpiceJet has been delightful. During this time, I have had the privilege of gaining knowledge",
        "and skills from our in-flight leaders. I started my",
        "journey with the Crew and climbed up the ladder to become a Manager. It has been challenging as well as exciting to take up new assignments. I extend my heartfelt acknowledgement for making these years worthwhile for me. I eagerly look forward to years of delivering exceptional services with SpiceJet.",
        "Internal appreciation:",
        "In the constellation of",
        "SpiceJet's finest, Prashant shines bright as a",
        "beacon of dedication and operational excellence. His adept handling of daily operations and IROPs, coupled with his strategic prowess in manpower planning for charters, especially",
        "in offline stations, has garnered widespread",
        "appreciation within the company. His ability to coordinate with internal departments and airports shows his commitment to SpiceJet's mission of serving the customers well.",
        "Experience with SpiceJet:",
        "With over two decades in aviation, my SpiceJet journey could be seen as a tale of growth, innovation, and recognition. As a part of the 'Red, Hot, and Spicy' family, I have nurtured leadership, embraced challenges and contributed to aviation's evolution, turning each moment into an honour and a step towards a visionary future in the industry.",
